@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ktv-nouns`
IMPORT `ktv-annex1-definitions`

-- AIA Khoe Tron Ven V012022 — Annex 4 (Phụ lục 4: Bảng hệ số bảo hiểm), the coverage
-- coefficients: the lowest and highest sum insured per dong of annualised basic premium, by sex
-- and issue age. One source row is one arm below, with its src line above it.
-- Quotations (`src:N`) are generated from line N of ../../source/raw/aia-khoe-tron-ven.txt.
--
-- "Tuổi phát hành" (issue age) is not defined; it is read as the insured's age in completed
-- years on the effective date, the measure Annex 1 uses for entry (fork F2). The male 40-44
-- row is split over two source lines by the page's watermark (src 1900-1901).

§ `Annex 4 — the coverage coefficient table`

-- src:1865 | Phụ lục 4: Bảng hệ số bảo hiểm
-- src:1867 | Hệ số bảo hiểm = Số tiền bảo hiểm/Phí bảo hiểm cơ bản định kỳ năm.
@ref Annex 4, "Hệ số bảo hiểm" (src 1867)
GIVEN `the sum insured`              IS A NUMBER
      `the annualised basic premium` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Annex 4 — the coverage coefficient of` `the sum insured` `over` `the annualised basic premium` MEANS
    `the sum insured` DIVIDED BY `the annualised basic premium`

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`Annex 4 has no row for an issue age above 65` MEANS
    REFUSE "Annex 4 has no row for an issue age above 65"

§§ `Men`

-- src:1868 | Dành cho Nam:
-- src:1870 | Tuổi phát hành Hệ số bảo hiểm tối thiểu Hệ số bảo hiểm tối đa
-- src:1872 | 0-4 55 75
-- src:1874 | 5-9 60 80
-- src:1876 | 10 - 14 55 75
-- src:1878 | 15 - 19 50 70
-- src:1880 | 20 - 24 45 65
-- src:1886 | 25 - 29 40 55
-- src:1892 | 30 - 34 35 50
-- src:1898 | 35 - 39 30 40
-- src:1900 | 40 - 44 25
-- src:1901 | OẢ 30
-- src:1903 | 45 - 49 20 25
-- src:1905 | 50 - 54 15 20
-- src:1909 | 55 - 59 10 15
-- src:1914 | 60 - 64 10 11
-- src:1920 | 65 8 9
@ref Annex 4, "Dành cho Nam" (src 1868-1920)
GIVEN `the issue age` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Coefficient limits`
`Annex 4 — the limits for a man of issue age` `the issue age` MEANS
    --                                                                                    minimum, maximum
    BRANCH IF `the issue age` AT MOST  4 THEN `Coefficient limits` OF 55, 75  -- src:1872
           IF `the issue age` AT MOST  9 THEN `Coefficient limits` OF 60, 80  -- src:1874
           IF `the issue age` AT MOST 14 THEN `Coefficient limits` OF 55, 75  -- src:1876
           IF `the issue age` AT MOST 19 THEN `Coefficient limits` OF 50, 70  -- src:1878
           IF `the issue age` AT MOST 24 THEN `Coefficient limits` OF 45, 65  -- src:1880
           IF `the issue age` AT MOST 29 THEN `Coefficient limits` OF 40, 55  -- src:1886
           IF `the issue age` AT MOST 34 THEN `Coefficient limits` OF 35, 50  -- src:1892
           IF `the issue age` AT MOST 39 THEN `Coefficient limits` OF 30, 40  -- src:1898
           IF `the issue age` AT MOST 44 THEN `Coefficient limits` OF 25, 30  -- src:1900-1901
           IF `the issue age` AT MOST 49 THEN `Coefficient limits` OF 20, 25  -- src:1903
           IF `the issue age` AT MOST 54 THEN `Coefficient limits` OF 15, 20  -- src:1905
           IF `the issue age` AT MOST 59 THEN `Coefficient limits` OF 10, 15  -- src:1909
           IF `the issue age` AT MOST 64 THEN `Coefficient limits` OF 10, 11  -- src:1914
           IF `the issue age` EQUALS  65 THEN `Coefficient limits` OF  8,  9  -- src:1920
           OTHERWISE `Annex 4 has no row for an issue age above 65`

