-- src:1968 | 60 - 64 10 14
-- src:1970 | 65 9 10
@ref Annex 4, "Dành cho Nữ" (src 1922-1970)
GIVEN `the issue age` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Coefficient limits`
`Annex 4 — the limits for a woman of issue age` `the issue age` MEANS
    --                                                                                    minimum, maximum
    BRANCH IF `the issue age` AT MOST  4 THEN `Coefficient limits` OF 65, 90  -- src:1931
           IF `the issue age` AT MOST  9 THEN `Coefficient limits` OF 65, 90  -- src:1938
           IF `the issue age` AT MOST 14 THEN `Coefficient limits` OF 65, 90  -- src:1940
           IF `the issue age` AT MOST 19 THEN `Coefficient limits` OF 55, 80  -- src:1942
           IF `the issue age` AT MOST 24 THEN `Coefficient limits` OF 50, 75  -- src:1944
           IF `the issue age` AT MOST 29 THEN `Coefficient limits` OF 45, 65  -- src:1946
           IF `the issue age` AT MOST 34 THEN `Coefficient limits` OF 40, 60  -- src:1948
           IF `the issue age` AT MOST 39 THEN `Coefficient limits` OF 35, 45  -- src:1950
           IF `the issue age` AT MOST 44 THEN `Coefficient limits` OF 30, 35  -- src:1952
           IF `the issue age` AT MOST 49 THEN `Coefficient limits` OF 25, 30  -- src:1957
           IF `the issue age` AT MOST 54 THEN `Coefficient limits` OF 20, 24  -- src:1964
           IF `the issue age` AT MOST 59 THEN `Coefficient limits` OF 15, 19  -- src:1966
           IF `the issue age` AT MOST 64 THEN `Coefficient limits` OF 10, 14  -- src:1968
           IF `the issue age` EQUALS  65 THEN `Coefficient limits` OF  9, 10  -- src:1970
           OTHERWISE `Annex 4 has no row for an issue age above 65`

§§ `Applying the table`

@ref Annex 4 (src 1865-1970)
GIVEN `the sex`       IS A Sex
      `the issue age` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Coefficient limits`
`Annex 4 — the limits for` `the sex` `of issue age` `the issue age` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the sex`
    WHEN `male`   THEN `Annex 4 — the limits for a man of issue age` `the issue age`
    WHEN `female` THEN `Annex 4 — the limits for a woman of issue age` `the issue age`

-- The issue age is the insured's age in completed years on the effective date (fork F2).
@ref Annex 4 (src 1865-1970); Articles 13(c) and 14 refer to "giới hạn theo bảng hệ số bảo hiểm"
GIVEN `the policy`                   IS A Policy
      `the sum insured`              IS A NUMBER
      `the annualised basic premium` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 4 — under` `the policy` `, the sum insured` `the sum insured` `is within the limits for the annualised basic premium` `the annualised basic premium` MEANS
        `the coefficient` AT LEAST `the limits`'s `minimum coefficient`
    AND `the coefficient` AT MOST  `the limits`'s `maximum coefficient`
    WHERE
        `the coefficient` MEANS `Annex 4 — the coverage coefficient of` `the sum insured` `over` `the annualised basic premium`
        `the limits`      MEANS `Annex 4 — the limits for` (`the policy`'s `the insured`'s `sex`) `of issue age` `the issue age`
        `the issue age`   MEANS `the age in completed years, of a person born on` (`the policy`'s `the insured`'s `date of birth`) `, on` (`the policy`'s `effective date`)
